        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ある日、僕はナルケパフネさんに海に呼び出された。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "cf684717e717e9f750c3a773083d85cc7fb9d23596ebc18dcb0c28be7e4cbd36",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あ、ご主人さま！　来てくれたんだ！\nしかも、水着なんだね。かわいい。",
      "jp_sha256": "3d3e1bae54cdb67c935464f4040a7dc3742055dee40620486fba21dfefda9ddd",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아, 주인님! 와 줬구나!\n게다가 수영복이네. 귀여워.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "c64f897b1e9fd0d68f12bab8e5fdad513a91ce209673d8ec6d86344b1eb03763:000002_1991935290313850630:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ナルケパフネ水着",
        "Emt3_Gla",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "あ、ご主人さま！　来てくれたんだ！\nしかも、水着なんだね。かわいい。",
        "",
        "ch_10287/R18/10287B0_10287_Nml/10287B0_10287_001",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ナルケパフネ水着",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10287/R18/10287B0_10287_Nml/10287B0_10287_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "026920cc9e55902058b5f9f1e1996c3d2a70432504990d5207d65f3a84bcf1bd",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "かわいいって言われるのは複雑ですが……。\nせっかく海にきたので着てきちゃいました。",
      "jp_sha256": "e19f17a1e3f3a3013f799f5e6b73d1a1ebc32d3c168b5f0fb986d3da8ff29d1a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "귀엽다는 말을 들으니 복잡하지만…….\n모처럼 바다에 왔으니 입고 왔어요.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "c64f897b1e9fd0d68f12bab8e5fdad513a91ce209673d8ec6d86344b1eb03763:000002_1991935290313850630:g0:r9",
      "row_index_0based": 9,
      "serialized_row_index": 9,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "かわいいって言われるのは複雑ですが……。\nせっかく海にきたので着てきちゃいました。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "50e8ff9cf7a81a1ed29dc95a7ecd3274c1343c3e82066743477041cc7647b923",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "うんうん、涼しそうでいいと思うよ。\n今日、すっごく暑いもんね。",
      "jp_sha256": "6cf11dc70a4b187405e3fcbd5ae1113150a2879d0bda8bfe46ccf55fc1899e65",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "응응, 시원해 보여서 좋은 것 같아.\n오늘 굉장히 덥잖아.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
