    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e4b096aaf30540f3ba4b65c5d6566376f2a6a5cd454efe71d039dc4d0127fe2f",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ナルケパフネさんは、\nクーラーボックスの牛乳を取り出して嬉しそうにする。\n彼女はミルクが本当に好物なのだ。",
      "jp_sha256": "54980f01d06257b8c9f0bbe3df6dfe468998f2e69c621e9c2886b9141a756ab9",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "나르케파프네 씨는\n아이스박스에서 우유를 꺼내며 기뻐했다.\n그녀는 우유를 정말 좋아했다.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 22,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "c64f897b1e9fd0d68f12bab8e5fdad513a91ce209673d8ec6d86344b1eb03763:000002_1991935290313850630:g0:r21",
      "row_index_0based": 21,
      "serialized_row_index": 21,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ナルケパフネさんは、\nクーラーボックスの牛乳を取り出して嬉しそうにする。\n彼女はミルクが本当に好物なのだ。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e848e4154846308cc785a851df027f7e397a2359b3d206913739097e12cf17f7",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あはは、いいですね！\nあ、でもミルクは暑さに弱くて腐りやすいですけど、\n本当に大丈夫ですか……？",
      "jp_sha256": "fa08b2c169e0c5b7b78ed4888b71f1d1926d85cfab5574f37ecde50fdf9987cf",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아하하, 좋네요!\n아, 하지만 우유는 더위에 약해서 쉽게 상하는데,\n정말 괜찮을까요……?",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 23,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
